+++# ---- deterministic unified diffs (-U3) with normalized headers -------------------
+++# Added files get a full-content /dev/null -> file diff so the apply script can
+++# reconstruct them byte-exactly (P31 lesson applied to NEW files this time).
+++import tempfile
