+PHASE_32_BINARY_SAFE_PATCH/PHASE_32_EXPECTED_FULL_SHA256.json which EXCLUDES all
+later-phase patch dirs (PHASE_30_/PHASE_31_/PHASE_32_BINARY_SAFE_PATCH) as
